1d84bbcc7aa40b71509f2ca9e0f/dogs-life-logo.png" srcSet="https://img.poki-cdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=78,scq=50,width=94,height=94,fit=cover,f=auto/9dd8c1d84bbcc7aa40b71509f2ca9e0f/dogs-life-logo.png 1x, https://img.poki-cdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=78,scq=50,width=188,height=188,fit=cover,f=auto/9dd8c1d84bbcc7aa40b71509f2ca9e0f/dogs-life-logo.png 2x" decoding="async" fetchPriority="high" width="94" height="94" class="ZkjjJvdHN77mDHPbAqAe" /></picture><figcaption class="pkyQYZUaPcJ5T7YkBgYe"><nav class="kd9Is9cTBZ_vuww2pWiX"><div class="wpZ3GoxLQVMZwH0a4VbJ"><div class="ywoqqyUKAOhwkYT8pgAd"><a href="/zh">游戏</a></div><div class="ywoqqyUKAOhwkYT8pgAd"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-chevron-down" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-chevron-down.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye FzCrgTBdL_UGZ6dZa4R7"></span><a href="/zh/动物">动物游戏</a></div></div></nav><h1 class="TIakIJk_seZmjAw2Dhmw">Dog's Life</h1><div class="JMcreCZt8qSHW4ejT2vM"><span>制作方: </span>Critters Studio</div></figcaption></figure><div class="tFZVF03PQZaPOzLciiSJ"><div>Dog's Life 是一款模拟游戏，让你化身顽皮小狗。漫游家中房间，收集骨头，与日常物品互动。享受每日冒险，体验宠物生活。</div><button type="button" class="buttonReset m82lRUpJLGRrwux8_eBE">查看更多<span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-plus" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-plus.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye"></span></button></div></div><div class="aYbRzQy1dkv5k0ahUrTx"><p>
《狗狗生活》是一款模拟游戏，你将扮演一只可爱的小狗，探索一整栋房子。在房间里闲逛，寻找骨头和金币，与你发现的所有东西互动，比如毛绒玩具、清洁机器人、眼镜，以及其他任何吸引你眼球的东西。或者干脆撕咬一番，何乐而不为呢？你是一只乖狗狗……大概吧。</p>

<h3>如何玩《狗狗生活》？</h3>
<p>
点击或轻触进行选择。使用WASD键或摇杆移动。</p>

<h3>谁创作了《狗狗生活》？</h3>
<p>

《狗狗生活》由 Critters Studio 开发。您还可以在以下平台玩他们的其他游戏： Poki (宝玩)： <a onclick="window.navigateTo('/zh/g/cat-simulator');return false;" href="https://poki.com/zh/g/cat-simulator">Cat Simulator</a>， <a onclick="window.navigateTo('/zh/g/merge-zoo');return false;" href="https://poki.com/zh/g/merge-zoo">Merge Zoo</a> 和 <a onclick="window.navigateTo('/zh/g/critters-quest');return false;" href="https://poki.com/zh/g/critters-quest">Critters Quest</a>！</p>



<h3>如何免费玩《狗狗生活》？</h3>
<p>你可以在 Poki 上免费玩 Dog&#39;s Life。</p>

<h3>我可以在手机和电脑上玩《狗狗生活》吗？</h3>
<p>
狗狗生活可以在电脑和移动设备（如手机和平板电脑）上玩。</p></div></div><div class="gnTU2EC40IjqezF8mtia L2_WH8qwnlLKoltC4VDR"><ul class="Z7DT_mB2R6VWvdLiCfMW"><li class="kGgaXgO0yXnelvq8Y3Hw R0z1YfwIRDgkk8baNsbd"><div class="L1TFlm6IkmY7qyb5HRjp"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-star-filled" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-star-filled.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye zKViGp56WRLVtF8ND6Xd"></span></div><div class="roMzUgDy9WIDLLdpqCZg">评分</div><div class="Bp3YqeHZTp31GR5MQtEN">4.3</div></li><li class="kGgaXgO0yXnelvq8Y3Hw xz9cXwTfzZBFchgcbAjv"><div class="L1TFlm6IkmY7qyb5HRjp"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-fire" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-fire.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye zKViGp56WRLVtF8ND6Xd"></span></div><div class="roMzUgDy9WIDLLdpqCZg">热门</div><div class="Bp3YqeHZTp31GR5MQtEN">#4</div></li><li class="kGgaXgO0yXnelvq8Y3Hw AkAOzOFTQDUloHVayVJM"><div class="L1TFlm6IkmY7qyb5HRjp"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-lightning" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-lightning.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye zKViGp56WRLVtF8ND6Xd"></span></div><div class="roMzUgDy9WIDLLdpqCZg">已更新</div><div class="Bp3YqeHZTp31GR5MQtEN">2026年8月</div></li></ul></div><div class="gnTU2EC40IjqezF8mtia kTngT1jPeeDVW_iVpBY3"><h2 class="mksXb8gjVNuyAlN4LgAP">关于此游戏</h2><ul class="ls7Q57iVJt400u5jthXr"><li class="S6UxDoNzkX4ZuUx7qmPq"><span class="_y5H6xC7p0G7OeZu54TP"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-device-scanning" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-device-scanning.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye ZfPBC5hXIpQLefXgh1Ap"></span><span class="XJ8BFNhAzfgqNHfNKsJp">支持的设备</span></span><div class="OnH32zdME8mMTJvgJkfm">电脑, 手机和平板</div></li><li class="S6UxDoNzkX4ZuUx7qmPq"><span class="_y5H6xC7p0G7OeZu54TP"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-code" style="--icon